<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cymer Inc upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cymer Inc upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Cymer Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- raised the 1997 earnings estimate to $1.17 a share from $1.10 a share and the 1998 estimate to $1.70 a share from $1.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- raised the price target to $65 a share from $60 a share. The time frame was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
